{"id":"63bffa02095213d3","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-ce-indexing.md","title":"Indexed Computably Enumerable Sets","display":"df-ce-indexing — Indexed Computably Enumerable Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-ce-indexing","aliases":["88-df-ce-indexing"],"display":"df-ce-indexing — Indexed Computably Enumerable Sets","depends_on":["[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-ce-indexing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-ce-indexing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ce-indexing — Indexed Computably Enumerable Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d2dec526682fb65\" href=\"?note=5d2dec526682fb65\" title=\"88-df-kleene-t-predicate\">88-df-kleene-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d2dec526682fb65\" href=\"?note=5d2dec526682fb65\" title=\"88-df-kleene-t-predicate\">88-df-kleene-t-predicate</a> 的标准句法机器编号及其诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li>该固定编号满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span>，其含义与标准编译论证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1(e,x,t)\">\\(T_1(e,x,t)\\)</span> 为同一编号的有限运行谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5d2dec526682fb65\" href=\"?note=5d2dec526682fb65\" title=\"88-df-kleene-t-predicate\">88-df-kleene-t-predicate</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s,x,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,s,x,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 是本文件定义的自然数集合与有限阶段近似。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}indexing}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nW_e\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_1(e,x,t)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}indexing}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nW_e\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_1(e,x,t)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}indexing}\\vdash\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nW_{e,s}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:x&lt;s\\land\\exists t&lt;s\\;T_1(e,x,t)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}indexing}\\vdash\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nW_{e,s}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:x&lt;s\\land\\exists t&lt;s\\;T_1(e,x,t)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}indexing}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(W_{e,0}=\\emptyset\\land W_{e,s}\\subseteq W_{e,s+1}\\subseteq W_e\n\\land W_{e,s}\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,s-1\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(W_e=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}W_{e,s}\\right),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;A=W_e\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}indexing}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(W_{e,0}=\\emptyset\\land W_{e,s}\\subseteq W_{e,s+1}\\subseteq W_e\n\\land W_{e,s}\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,s-1\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(W_e=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}W_{e,s}\\right),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;A=W_e\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一行是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 的唯一正式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 始终是自然数集合，绝不直接表示神谕规则三元组。阶段近似使用有界运行证据搜索，因而对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,s,x)\">\\((e,s,x)\\)</span> 一致可判定，且每个阶段都是有限集。空集也有索引。</p>\n<p>最后一个等价式由 c.e. 集的定义域刻画和有效编号的满性推出。神谕规则的数码可以作为某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 的元素，但把数码解成规则、排除冲突、补全扩张闭包是另一个构造，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]] 的标准句法机器编号及其诱导的 $\\boldsymbol\\varphi$；$\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}$ 见 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]] 的标准句法机器编号及其诱导的 $\\boldsymbol\\varphi$；$\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}$ 见 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"该固定编号满足 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$，其含义与标准编译论证见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_1(e,x,t)$ 为同一编号的有限运行谓词，见 [[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"最后一个等价式由 c.e. 集的定义域刻画和有效编号的满性推出。神谕规则的数码可以作为某个 $W_e$ 的元素，但把数码解成规则、排除冲突、补全扩张闭包是另一个构造，见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"T_1(e,x,t)","display":false},{"tex":"e,s,x,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"W_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}indexing}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nW_e\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_1(e,x,t)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}indexing}\\vdash\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nW_{e,s}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb N:x<s\\land\\exists t<s\\;T_1(e,x,t)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ce\\text{-}indexing}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(W_{e,0}=\\emptyset\\land W_{e,s}\\subseteq W_{e,s+1}\\subseteq W_e\n\\land W_{e,s}\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,s-1\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(W_e=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}W_{e,s}\\right),\\\\\n&\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;A=W_e\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"(e,s,x)","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false}],"bytes":2219,"backlinks":[{"id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W_{e,s}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]。"},{"id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W_e$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]，仅指普通编号的 c.e. 自然数集合，不充当 $F_e$ 的替代名称。"},{"id":"6a215fa4f19a6a0b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (canonical c.e. sets, $W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)$, see [[88-df-ce-indexing]])"},{"id":"8c35cc87b3063540","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W_e,W_{e,s}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 见 [[88-df-encoding]]。"},{"id":"c24d037bf910fb4b","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1},\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；普通程序采用 [[88-df-ce-indexing]] 的固定标准可接受编号，其参数固化定理见 [[88-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\bigoplus$ 与 $\\oplus$ 导入 [[88-df-effective-join]]；$W_e,W_{e,s}$ 导入 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$F_e$ 导入 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md